  stepId: Step_14_AccessLevels
  instructionText: 'LO1.2 - Access goes to a GROUP, then the person goes into the
    group.


    Start > Active Directory Users and Computers. Select Users, then
    New > Group. Name it, choose Global and Security, then OK.


    Its Properties
    window opens by itself on the General tab. Click MEMBERS, type the account name
    in object name, then press ''Add'' not OK - that is what completes the step.'
